        "HireRight Background Check Report, Request #: OR-052826-TD9W3 (dated May 28–29, 2026) — Complete Report showing SSN Validation, SS Trace, Court Records across multiple jurisdictions, National Sex Offender Registry (Pending), Widescreen Plus National Criminal Search (Completed)",
        "HireRight Internal Comments dated May 29, 2026: 3:56 PM PDT — 'APPLICANT IS LISTED ON THE SEX OFFENDER REGISTRY IN THE STATE OF CA'; 3:57 PM PDT — 'Verified by Aka Name, DOB and Address'; 3:57 PM PDT — Statutory Warning: 'Information from the California Sex Offenders' Registry may not be used for employment purposes except to protect a person at risk. See CA Penal Code Section 290.46'",
